      "body": "Sterling Powergensys Limited held its Board of Directors meeting on May 29, 2026, appointed Mr. Periasamy Mathialagan as Additional Non-Executive Director of the Company with effect from June 13, 2026, based on the recommendations of the Nomination and Remuneration Committee. Mr. Periasamy Mathialagan holds a bachelor’s degree in chemistry from Annamalai University, an LL.B. (Hons.) from University of London, and an MBA from Nottingham Trent University. He has extensive experience in strategic consultancy for multinational corporations across the maritime, energy, and manufacturing sectors. Since 2019, he has been serving on the Board of Directors of Greenbatt Technology Holding AG, contributing to the company’s global growth and battery energy storage initiatives.",
